      ],
      "en": "Help, LORD; for the godly man ceases. For the faithful fail from among the children of men.",
      "ko": "여호와여 도우소서 경건한 자가 끊어지며 충실한 자가 인생 중에 없어지도소이다",
      "source_text_hash": "86ce8601c1c9ae109707a1c860c4593764f5a6d82c415024f36b92a530a84c39",
      "translation_text_hash": "c31bdd55f1c958ef8302ef81ba2077e5c6b0ce1b95aa653ea475bbdba6342df9",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
