          "book": "PSA",
          "chapter": 12,
          "verse": 6
        }
      ],
      "en": "The LORD’s words are flawless words, as silver refined in a clay furnace, purified seven times.",
      "ko": "여호와의 말씀은 순결함이여 흙 도가니에 일곱번 단련한 은 같도다",
      "source_text_hash": "715a90a8c400ea899e902be6e17ec379d0d3de40af2e765cbc9a3dfddb113f3b",
      "translation_text_hash": "997ed28357b62a49c85dc519f47091b411f54fbffed462905aacbc836ef97503",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "여호와의 말씀은 순결함이여 흙 도가니에 일곱번 단련한 은 같도다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "997ed28357b62a49c85dc519f47091b411f54fbffed462905aacbc836ef97503"
      ]
    },
